Also remove SCROLL from `greedyFills` (since handled above). Let me check greedyFills:
```cpp
bool greedyFills(uint16_t component, bool main_axis) {
    switch (component) {
    case PL_COMP_SPACER: return main_axis;
    case PL_COMP_DIVIDER: return !main_axis;
    case PL_COMP_COLOR:
    case PL_COMP_SCROLL:
    case PL_COMP_SIZE_THAT_FITS:
