Let me double-check the `MEDIA_POSITION` guard interacts correctly with the **seek slider**: the user drags the seek bar → `seekRequest` changes → the emitter sends MEDIA_POSITION with the new value → the guard sees a different value → seeks. Then the renderer reports `MEDIA_TIME_UPDATED` continuously; the seekRequest doesn't change. On a volume change, the full re-send sends the last seekRequest (e.g., 30) → the guard sees it equals the last applied (30) → skips. Good.

